  data: {
    LLM: "Only stay in the hand if you have at least one high trump or a void in a side suit that allows you to trump early and secure your safety trick.\n\nThe 'Exchange' Tell: Watch how many cards opponents draw. A player drawing 1 card likely has a strong four-flush or triple; a player drawing 3 is gambling on the draw.\n\nDefensive Over-trumping: If you hold the second-best trump, wait for the leader to play trumps so you can over-trump and seize control, potentially 'Beasting' (Bourréing) the opponents.",
    Player: "Only stay in the hand if you have at least one high trump or a void in a side suit that allows you to trump early and secure your safety trick.\n\nThe 'Exchange' Tell: Watch how many cards opponents draw. A player drawing 1 card likely has a strong four-flush or triple; a player drawing 3 is gambling on the draw.\n\nDefensive Over-trumping: If you hold the second-best trump, wait for the leader to play trumps so you can over-trump and seize control, potentially 'Beasting' (Bourréing) the opponents.",
